    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41953" root="وشب" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشْبٌ</span></b>  [app. meaning <i>Fleshy</i>] is from the expression <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمْرَةٌ وَشْبَةٌ</span>, (in one copy of the K, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشْبَاءُ</span>,
TA,) <i>A date having a thick</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِحَآء</span> [i. e. <i>pulp,</i> or
<i>flesh</i>]. (K.) Of the dial. of El-Yemen. (TA.)

